{"availability":"available","full":"baryon/markdown-live-preview","name":"markdown-live-preview","description":"Explore this public GitHub project.","category":"Productivity","language":"TypeScript","stars":9,"forks":2,"created":"2026-02-04T03:17:06Z","updated":"2026-03-12T10:36:05Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":null,"topics":[],"demo":"https://marketplace.visualstudio.com/items?itemName=baryon.baryon-markdown-live-preview","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T20:34:24.066Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-16T20:34:24.066Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-16T20:34:24.066Z","lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T20:34:24.066Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-03T21:18:25.321Z","stars":9,"forks":2},{"at":"2026-10-04T05:48:48.609Z","stars":9,"forks":2},{"at":"2026-10-05T16:57:28.837Z","stars":9,"forks":2},{"at":"2026-10-07T18:41:38.894Z","stars":9,"forks":2},{"at":"2026-10-09T19:32:35.058Z","stars":9,"forks":2},{"at":"2026-10-13T06:36:25.225Z","stars":9,"forks":2},{"at":"2026-10-16T20:34:24.066Z","stars":9,"forks":2}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A modern VS Code extension for previewing Markdown — built for the AI era, where documents are generated first and read second.","Preview-first. Because in the age of AI, you read more Markdown than you write.","AI tools like Claude, ChatGPT, and Copilot generate Markdown at scale — technical docs, reports, slide decks, research notes. The bottleneck is no longer writing; it's reviewing and presenting what was written. Markdown Live Preview is designed around this reality: open a file, see it rendered, navigate it, present it."],"features":["Default open mode is configurable: edit, preview, or side-by-side.","15 built-in mermaid themes: github-light, github-dark, tokyo-night, catppuccin-mocha, dracula, nord, solarized-light, and more. An ASCII rendering mode is also available for terminal-friendly output.","Alice -> Bob: Hello Bob --> Alice: Hi","Supported languages: PlantUML, GraphViz/DOT, D2, Ditaa, BlockDiag, Mermaid, Nomnoml, Pikchr, Excalidraw, SVGBob, Structurizr, ERD, DBML, TikZ, WireViz, and more.","Supported chart types: LineChart, BarChart, AreaChart, PieChart, ComposedChart, ScatterChart, RadarChart. Common components like XAxis, YAxis, CartesianGrid, Tooltip, Legend are all supported."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/baryon/markdown-live-preview/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"ac9e3bfe056a639859d5574b7258e3c4dd632430cff26da8d82f491baa7950ba","extractedAt":"2026-10-03T05:59:17.629Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T20:34:24.161Z","overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-03-12T10:36:05Z","overviewAttemptAt":"2026-10-11T14:54:15.343Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A modern VS Code extension for previewing Markdown — built for the AI era, where documents are generated first and read second.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/baryon/markdown-live-preview/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[{"text":"A modern VS Code extension for previewing Markdown — built for the AI era, where documents are generated first and read second.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/baryon/markdown-live-preview/blob/main/README.md"}],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"ac9e3bfe056a639859d5574b7258e3c4dd632430cff26da8d82f491baa7950ba","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/baryon/markdown-live-preview/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-16T20:34:24.162Z"},"readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/baryon/markdown-live-preview/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-16T20:34:24.163Z","hash":"ac9e3bfe056a639859d5574b7258e3c4dd632430cff26da8d82f491baa7950ba","originalBytes":16625,"storedBytes":16625,"truncated":false},"qualityPriority":false,"enrichmentAttemptAt":"2026-10-04T21:35:16.549Z","latestRelease":{"name":"v1.6.4","tag":"v1.6.4","publishedAt":"2026-03-12T10:36:15Z","url":"https://github.com/baryon/markdown-live-preview/releases/tag/v1.6.4"},"releaseCheckedAt":"2026-10-04T21:35:16.549Z","screenshots":[{"